WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.800
Rest a fingertip lightly on a table.

2
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.560
You feel it at once.

3
00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:09.950
Step outside on a clear night, and a dim
glimmer of starlight reaches your eye.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.510
So how does a gentle press on your
skin, or a dim glimmer of light,

5
00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:16.980
become a message a nerve can carry?

6
00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.630
In this mission, you'll meet receptors,
and find out why each one responds only

7
00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:23.420
to certain stimuli.

8
00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:28.200
Then you'll find out why a stimulus that
is too weak sends no message at all.

9
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.090
Your mission: find out how a gentle press,

10
00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:35.470
or a dim glimmer of light, becomes
a message a nerve can carry.
